VP-778 - Using the Embedded Web Pages 63 
 
 
9.2.7 Auto Switching 
To set the auto switching mode: 
1. In the Navigation pane, click Routing & Scaling. The Routing & Scaling 
page appears. 
2. Click Auto Switching. 
The Auto Switching window appears: 
 
Figure 31: Routing & Scaling Page – Auto Switching Window 
3. Open the drop-down list to set the switching mode (Off, Scan or Last 
Connected).